          %p
            The general principle of the pre-metric formulation, understood as a form of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/self-dual+higher+gauge+theory"} self-dual higher gauge theory
          %ul
            %li#Freed02
